# Which encoding each of OpenAI's models reads, by its whole name or by the
# start of it, as tiktoken 0.14.0 answers `encoding_name_for_model`: a
# whole name first, then the first start, in this order, that the name
# begins with. Nothing here is edited by hand: the one-off program
# `gen_tables.py`, kept outside the tree in the round's scratch folder
# (`.claude/worktrees/rebel-scratch/tokenizer/gen/`), read tiktoken's two
# tables on 2026-11-18 and wrote this module whole.

